# No cold gas and Vmax 20: the excess disk stars move to the bulge and InstabilityBulgeMass; the
# gas branch is not reached (ColdGas 0).
# Constructed input (not R0 output); every value is set explicitly. All flags and parameters are
# R0's unless a line says NOT R0.
format sage26-oracle-fixture 1
routine check_disk_instability

